Notebook[{
  Cell["Revestimiento circular: escenario determinístico de cálculo", "Title"],
  Cell["Cuaderno independiente para el control de las acciones perimetrales y de las resultantes seccionales", "Subtitle"],

  Cell["Objeto y alcance", "Section"],
  Cell["Este cuaderno reproduce un único escenario determinístico de AR-SAD40. Se organiza como una memoria de cálculo: presenta las entradas, desarrolla cada etapa y muestra sus resultados inmediatamente después de evaluarla. R continúa siendo la implementación de producción; los productos R se importan únicamente al final para efectuar el control cruzado.", "Text"],
  Cell["El cálculo termina en N_theta(theta), M_theta(theta) y Q_theta(theta). No ejecuta Monte Carlo, no calcula resistencia de la chapa, juntas o pernos y no introduce datos de deterioro. La recuperación de tensión normal circunferencial se informa como no evaluada mientras falten las coordenadas firmadas de las fibras y el criterio de aplicabilidad de la recuperación lineal.", "Text"],
  Cell["Uso. Abra este archivo en Wolfram y seleccione Evaluation > Evaluate Notebook. Las entradas, tablas de resultados, controles y diagramas aparecerán en orden debajo de cada celda de cálculo. Esta versión está vinculada exclusivamente a la fixture verification-biaxial-uniform; no constituye una plantilla general para otros escenarios.", "Text"],

  Cell["1. Convenciones y ecuaciones", "Section"],
  Cell["La coordenada theta vale cero en la clave y aumenta en sentido horario. Pr es positiva hacia el exterior; Pt es positiva en el sentido de theta; N_theta es positiva a tracción. M_theta y Q_theta siguen las ecuaciones de equilibrio indicadas a continuación.", "Text"],
  Cell["dN_theta/dtheta - Q_theta + R Pt = 0", "Equation"],
  Cell["dQ_theta/dtheta + N_theta - R Pr = 0", "Equation"],
  Cell["dM_theta/dtheta - R Q_theta = 0", "Equation"],
  Cell["La carga representa la proyección de un estado biaxial uniforme de tensiones efectivas. El multiplicador alpha escala solamente la componente tangencial prescrita: alpha = 0 la omite y alpha = 1 aplica la proyección completa. Alpha no es un coeficiente de fricción.", "Text"],

  Cell["2. Ubicación del proyecto y lectura de entradas", "Section"],
  Cell["El cuaderno lee calculation.json como fuente de los valores de la fixture verification-biaxial-uniform. Antes de calcular comprueba el identificador del escenario, la versión del esquema, la rama K0 constante, el estado no modelado del incremento horizontal y los dos casos de alpha. Si ese contrato cambia, la evaluación se detiene. Al abrir el archivo desde su ubicación normal no es necesario indicar rutas. La variable de entorno AR_SAD40_ROOT se reserva para el control con el kernel nativo, sin modificar la superficie de uso del cuaderno.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData["ClearAll[importCSV, perimeterActions, closedResultants, resultantSummary, directResultantsFromLoad, directResultants, fourierResultants];
rootOverride = Environment[\"AR_SAD40_ROOT\"];
projectRoot = If[StringQ[rootOverride] && StringLength[rootOverride] > 0,
  ExpandFileName[rootOverride],
  If[$FrontEnd === Null,
    Directory[],
    ExpandFileName[FileNameJoin[{NotebookDirectory[], \"..\", \"..\"}]]
  ]
];
configPath = FileNameJoin[{projectRoot, \"calculation.json\"}];
config = Import[configPath, \"RawJSON\"];
scenarioID = config[\"scenarioID\"];
expectedScenarioID = \"verification-biaxial-uniform\";
fixtureSupported = And[
  scenarioID === expectedScenarioID,
  config[\"schemaVersion\"] === \"2.0.0\",
  config[\"stressState\"][\"k0Model\"][\"modelID\"] === \"adopted-constant\",
  config[\"stressState\"][\"horizontalIncrementMode\"] === \"unknown-not-modeled\",
  Lookup[config[\"loadCases\"], \"caseID\"] === {\"alpha-1\", \"alpha-0\"},
  Lookup[config[\"loadCases\"], \"alpha\"] === {1., 0.}
];
If[Not[TrueQ[fixtureSupported]],
  Print[Style[\"La entrada no corresponde a la fixture admitida por este cuaderno.\", Red, Bold]];
  Abort[]
];
configHash = IntegerString[FileHash[configPath, \"SHA256\"], 16, 64];
Dataset[{<|
  \"Escenario\" -> scenarioID,
  \"Archivo\" -> configPath,
  \"SHA256\" -> configHash,
  \"VersionEsquema\" -> config[\"schemaVersion\"]
|>}]"] , "Input", CellTags -> {"ProjectInputs"}],

  Cell[BoxData["insideDiameterM = config[\"geometry\"][\"insideDiameterM\"];
radiusM = insideDiameterM/2;
profileID = config[\"section\"][\"referenceProfileID\"];
baseThicknessMm = config[\"section\"][\"analysisBaseThicknessMm\"];
youngModulusGPa = config[\"material\"][\"circumferentialYoungModulusGPa\"];
effectiveVerticalKPa = config[\"stressState\"][\"effectiveVerticalKPa\"];
waterPressureDifferenceKPa = config[\"stressState\"][\"waterPressureDifferenceKPa\"];
k0Model = config[\"stressState\"][\"k0Model\"];
loadCases = config[\"loadCases\"];
inputRows = {
  <|\"Magnitud\" -> \"Diámetro interior\", \"Símbolo\" -> \"D_i\", \"Valor\" -> insideDiameterM, \"Unidad\" -> \"m\"|>,
  <|\"Magnitud\" -> \"Radio de análisis\", \"Símbolo\" -> \"R\", \"Valor\" -> radiusM, \"Unidad\" -> \"m\"|>,
  <|\"Magnitud\" -> \"Espesor base\", \"Símbolo\" -> \"t_b\", \"Valor\" -> baseThicknessMm, \"Unidad\" -> \"mm\"|>,
  <|\"Magnitud\" -> \"Módulo circunferencial\", \"Símbolo\" -> \"E_theta\", \"Valor\" -> youngModulusGPa, \"Unidad\" -> \"GPa\"|>,
  <|\"Magnitud\" -> \"Tensión vertical efectiva\", \"Símbolo\" -> \"sigma'_v\", \"Valor\" -> effectiveVerticalKPa, \"Unidad\" -> \"kPa\"|>,
  <|\"Magnitud\" -> \"Diferencia de presión de agua\", \"Símbolo\" -> \"Delta u\", \"Valor\" -> waterPressureDifferenceKPa, \"Unidad\" -> \"kPa\"|>,
  <|\"Magnitud\" -> \"Modelo de K0\", \"Símbolo\" -> \"K0\", \"Valor\" -> k0Model[\"modelID\"], \"Unidad\" -> \"-\"|>,
  <|\"Magnitud\" -> \"Casos de alpha\", \"Símbolo\" -> \"alpha\", \"Valor\" -> Row[Lookup[loadCases, \"alpha\"], \", \"], \"Unidad\" -> \"-\"|>
};
Dataset[inputRows]"] , "Input", CellTags -> {"InputTable"}],

  Cell["3. Propiedades circunferenciales de la sección", "Section"],
  Cell["Las propiedades A_theta e I_theta se interpolan linealmente entre las dos filas publicadas que encierran el espesor base. Las conversiones son 1 mm2/mm = 10^-3 m2/m y 1 mm4/mm = 10^-9 m4/m. Las rigideces EA_theta y EI_theta se conservan por separado.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData["ClearAll[parseCSVLine, parseCSVValue, importCSV];
parseCSVLine[line_] := Module[
  {characters = Characters[line], fields = {}, current = \"\", quoted = False, i = 1, character},
  While[i <= Length[characters],
    character = characters[[i]];
    Which[
      character == \"\\\"\" && quoted && i < Length[characters] && characters[[i + 1]] == \"\\\"\",
        current = current <> \"\\\"\"; i++,
      character == \"\\\"\", quoted = Not[quoted],
      character == \",\" && Not[quoted], AppendTo[fields, current]; current = \"\",
      True, current = current <> character
    ];
    i++
  ];
  Append[fields, current]
];
parseCSVValue[value_] := If[
  StringMatchQ[value, RegularExpression[\"[+-]?(?:[0-9]+(?:\\\\.[0-9]*)?|\\\\.[0-9]+)(?:[eE][+-]?[0-9]+)?\"]],
  ToExpression[StringReplace[value, RegularExpression[\"[eE]([+-]?[0-9]+)$\"] :> \"*^$1\"]],
  value
];
importCSV[path_] := Module[{lines, fields, header},
  lines = Select[StringSplit[ReadString[path], {\"\\r\\n\", \"\\n\", \"\\r\"}], StringLength[#] > 0 &];
  fields = parseCSVLine /@ lines;
  header = First[fields];
  AssociationThread[header, parseCSVValue /@ #] & /@ Rest[fields]
];
sectionReferencePath = FileNameJoin[{projectRoot, config[\"section\"][\"propertyTable\"]}];
sectionReferenceHash = IntegerString[FileHash[sectionReferencePath, \"SHA256\"], 16, 64];
sectionReference = importCSV[sectionReferencePath];
profileRows = SortBy[
  Select[sectionReference, #[\"profileID\"] == profileID &],
  #[\"baseThicknessMm\"] &
];
lowerRow = Last[Select[profileRows, #[\"baseThicknessMm\"] <= baseThicknessMm &]];
upperRow = First[Select[profileRows, #[\"baseThicknessMm\"] >= baseThicknessMm &]];
interpolationFraction = (baseThicknessMm - lowerRow[\"baseThicknessMm\"])/
  (upperRow[\"baseThicknessMm\"] - lowerRow[\"baseThicknessMm\"]);
areaMm2PerMm = (1 - interpolationFraction) lowerRow[\"areaMm2PerMm\"] +
  interpolationFraction upperRow[\"areaMm2PerMm\"];
inertiaMm4PerMm = (1 - interpolationFraction) lowerRow[\"inertiaMm4PerMm\"] +
  interpolationFraction upperRow[\"inertiaMm4PerMm\"];
areaM2PerM = areaMm2PerMm 10^-3;
inertiaM4PerM = inertiaMm4PerMm 10^-9;
youngModulusKPa = youngModulusGPa 10^6;
extensionalRigidityKnPerM = youngModulusKPa areaM2PerM;
flexuralRigidityKnM2PerM = youngModulusKPa inertiaM4PerM;
sectionRatio = inertiaM4PerM/(areaM2PerM radiusM^2);
sectionState = <|
  \"profileID\" -> profileID,
  \"referenceSHA256\" -> sectionReferenceHash,
  \"lowerReferenceRowID\" -> lowerRow[\"referenceRowID\"],
  \"upperReferenceRowID\" -> upperRow[\"referenceRowID\"],
  \"interpolationFraction\" -> interpolationFraction,
  \"areaMm2PerMm\" -> areaMm2PerMm,
  \"inertiaMm4PerMm\" -> inertiaMm4PerMm,
  \"extensionalRigidityKnPerM\" -> extensionalRigidityKnPerM,
  \"flexuralRigidityKnM2PerM\" -> flexuralRigidityKnM2PerM,
  \"sectionRatio\" -> sectionRatio
|>;
Dataset[{sectionState}]"] , "Input", CellTags -> {"SectionProperties"}],

  Cell["4. Estado tensional y acciones perimetrales", "Section"],
  Cell["El escenario adopta K0 como constante. Por lo tanto sigma'_h = K0 sigma'_v. El incremento horizontal asociado a compactación o a presión residual conserva el estado unknown-not-modeled y no se reemplaza por un valor supuesto. La diferencia de presión de agua sí es un dato del escenario.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData["k0Applied = k0Model[\"k0\"];
effectiveHorizontalKPa = k0Applied effectiveVerticalKPa;
horizontalIncrementStatus = config[\"stressState\"][\"horizontalIncrementMode\"];
stressState = <|
  \"modelID\" -> k0Model[\"modelID\"],
  \"effectiveVerticalKPa\" -> effectiveVerticalKPa,
  \"k0Input\" -> k0Applied,
  \"k0Derived\" -> Missing[\"NotApplicable\"],
  \"k0Applied\" -> k0Applied,
  \"domainStatus\" -> \"not-applicable\",
  \"horizontalIncrementKPa\" -> Missing[\"UnknownNotModeled\"],
  \"effectiveHorizontalKPa\" -> effectiveHorizontalKPa,
  \"horizontalIncrementStatus\" -> horizontalIncrementStatus,
  \"waterPressureDifferenceKPa\" -> waterPressureDifferenceKPa
|>;
Dataset[{stressState}]"] , "Input", CellTags -> {"StressState"}],

  Cell["Para P = Delta u + (sigma'_v + sigma'_h)/2 y Delta sigma = sigma'_v - sigma'_h, las acciones prescritas son Pr(theta) = -P - Delta sigma cos(2 theta)/2 y Pt(theta) = alpha Delta sigma sin(2 theta)/2.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData["thetaPointCount = config[\"numerics\"][\"baseThetaPointCount\"];
criticalAnglesDeg = config[\"numerics\"][\"criticalAnglesDeg\"];
thetaExact = Sort[DeleteDuplicates[Join[
  Range[0, thetaPointCount - 1] 2 Pi/thetaPointCount,
  Rationalize[criticalAnglesDeg, 0] Pi/180
]]];
theta = N[thetaExact];
meanEffectivePressureKPa = (effectiveVerticalKPa + effectiveHorizontalKPa)/2;
stressDifferenceKPa = effectiveVerticalKPa - effectiveHorizontalKPa;
ClearAll[perimeterActions];
perimeterActions[alpha_] := <|
  \"Pr\" -> -waterPressureDifferenceKPa - meanEffectivePressureKPa -
    stressDifferenceKPa Cos[2 theta]/2,
  \"Pt\" -> alpha stressDifferenceKPa Sin[2 theta]/2
|>;
actionsByCase = Association@Table[
  case[\"caseID\"] -> perimeterActions[case[\"alpha\"]],
  {case, loadCases}
];
actionInspectionAnglesDeg = {0, 45, 90, 135};
actionInspectionRows = Flatten[Table[
  index = First[FirstPosition[thetaExact, angle Pi/180]];
  {
    <|\"caseID\" -> case[\"caseID\"], \"alpha\" -> case[\"alpha\"], \"thetaDeg\" -> angle, \"Componente\" -> \"Pr\", \"ValorKPa\" -> actionsByCase[case[\"caseID\"]][\"Pr\"][[index]]|>,
    <|\"caseID\" -> case[\"caseID\"], \"alpha\" -> case[\"alpha\"], \"thetaDeg\" -> angle, \"Componente\" -> \"Pt\", \"ValorKPa\" -> actionsByCase[case[\"caseID\"]][\"Pt\"][[index]]|>
  },
  {case, loadCases}, {angle, actionInspectionAnglesDeg}
], 2];
Dataset[actionInspectionRows]"] , "Input", CellTags -> {"PerimeterActions"}],

  Cell["5. Solución cerrada para el estado biaxial", "Section"],
  Cell["La solución cerrada incluye el acoplamiento del modo uniforme mediante eta = I_theta/(A_theta R^2). Para cada alpha se emplean los factores (1 + 2 alpha)/6, (2 + alpha)/12 y (2 + alpha)/6 en N_theta, M_theta y Q_theta, respectivamente.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData["closedFormTolerance = config[\"numerics\"][\"closedFormTolerance\"];
ClearAll[closedResultants];
closedResultants[alpha_] := Module[
  {meanPressure, meanNormal, uniformCoupling, meanMoment},
  meanPressure = waterPressureDifferenceKPa + meanEffectivePressureKPa;
  meanNormal = -radiusM meanPressure;
  uniformCoupling = radiusM sectionRatio/(1 + sectionRatio);
  meanMoment = uniformCoupling meanNormal;
  <|
    \"N\" -> meanNormal + radiusM stressDifferenceKPa (1 + 2 alpha)/6 Cos[2 theta],
    \"M\" -> meanMoment + radiusM^2 stressDifferenceKPa (2 + alpha)/12 Cos[2 theta],
    \"Q\" -> -radiusM stressDifferenceKPa (2 + alpha)/6 Sin[2 theta]
  |>
];
closedByCase = Association@Table[
  case[\"caseID\"] -> closedResultants[case[\"alpha\"]],
  {case, loadCases}
];
ClearAll[resultantSummary];
resultantSummary[caseID_, values_] := Flatten[Table[
  Module[{vector, unit, minimum, maximum, absoluteMaximum, positionTolerance,
    equivalentIndices, representativeIndices, signedValues},
    vector = values[resultantID];
    unit = If[resultantID == \"M\", \"kN m/m\", \"kN/m\"];
    minimum = Min[vector];
    maximum = Max[vector];
    absoluteMaximum = Max[Abs[vector]];
    positionTolerance = closedFormTolerance;
    equivalentIndices = {
      Flatten[Position[Abs[vector - minimum], value_ /; value <= positionTolerance]],
      Flatten[Position[Abs[vector - maximum], value_ /; value <= positionTolerance]],
      Flatten[Position[Abs[Abs[vector] - absoluteMaximum], value_ /; value <= positionTolerance]]
    };
    representativeIndices = First /@ equivalentIndices;
    signedValues = vector[[representativeIndices]];
    MapThread[
      <|\"caseID\" -> caseID, \"resultantID\" -> resultantID,
        \"statisticID\" -> #1, \"value\" -> #2, \"signedValue\" -> #3,
        \"thetaRad\" -> theta[[#4]], \"thetaDeg\" -> theta[[#4]] 180/Pi,
        \"equivalentThetaDeg\" -> theta[[#5]] 180/Pi, \"unit\" -> unit|> &,
      {{\"minimum\", \"maximum\", \"absolute-maximum\"},
       {minimum, maximum, absoluteMaximum}, signedValues,
       representativeIndices, equivalentIndices}
    ]
  ],
  {resultantID, {\"N\", \"M\", \"Q\"}}
], 1];
closedSummary = Flatten[
  KeyValueMap[resultantSummary, closedByCase],
  1
];
Dataset[closedSummary]"] , "Input", CellTags -> {"ClosedSolution"}],

  Cell["6. Integración directa de las ecuaciones de equilibrio", "Section"],
  Cell["La integración directa obtiene primero una solución particular con condiciones iniciales nulas. Las constantes homogéneas se determinan mediante periodicidad, ausencia de los modos de cuerpo rígido cos(theta) y sin(theta) en M_theta, y el acoplamiento entre los valores medios de M_theta y N_theta. Esta solución no usa los CSV de R.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData["ClearAll[directResultantsFromLoad, directResultants];
directResultantsFromLoad[pr_, pt_, ratio_] := Module[
  {x, solution, nP, qP, mP, iMC, iMS, iN, iM, iFx, iFz, iT,
   mCosOne, mSinOne, meanNormalParticular, meanMomentParticular,
   cosineConstant, sineConstant, uniformCoupling, momentConstant,
   globalLoads, closureResidual, characteristicPressure, balanceMetric},
  solution = NDSolveValue[{
    nP'[x] == qP[x] - radiusM pt[x],
    qP'[x] == radiusM pr[x] - nP[x],
    mP'[x] == radiusM qP[x],
    iMC'[x] == mP[x] Cos[x],
    iMS'[x] == mP[x] Sin[x],
    iN'[x] == nP[x],
    iM'[x] == mP[x],
    iFx'[x] == radiusM (pr[x] Sin[x] + pt[x] Cos[x]),
    iFz'[x] == radiusM (-pr[x] Cos[x] + pt[x] Sin[x]),
    iT'[x] == radiusM^2 pt[x],
    Thread[{nP[0], qP[0], mP[0], iMC[0], iMS[0], iN[0], iM[0], iFx[0], iFz[0], iT[0]} == ConstantArray[0., 10]]
  }, {nP, qP, mP, iMC, iMS, iN, iM, iFx, iFz, iT}, {x, 0, 2 Pi},
  AccuracyGoal -> 12, PrecisionGoal -> 10, MaxStepFraction -> 1/200,
  MaxSteps -> Infinity];
  mCosOne = solution[[4]][2 Pi]/Pi;
  mSinOne = solution[[5]][2 Pi]/Pi;
  meanNormalParticular = solution[[6]][2 Pi]/(2 Pi);
  meanMomentParticular = solution[[7]][2 Pi]/(2 Pi);
  cosineConstant = -mCosOne/radiusM;
  sineConstant = -mSinOne/radiusM;
  uniformCoupling = radiusM ratio/(1 + ratio);
  momentConstant = uniformCoupling meanNormalParticular - meanMomentParticular;
  globalLoads = Through[solution[[8 ;; 10]][2 Pi]];
  closureResidual = Through[solution[[1 ;; 3]][2 Pi]];
  characteristicPressure = Max[Abs[Join[pr /@ theta, pt /@ theta]]];
  balanceMetric = Max[Abs[Join[
    globalLoads/{2 Pi radiusM characteristicPressure, 2 Pi radiusM characteristicPressure, 2 Pi radiusM^2 characteristicPressure},
    closureResidual/{radiusM characteristicPressure, radiusM characteristicPressure, radiusM^2 characteristicPressure}
  ]]];
  <|
    \"N\" -> ((solution[[1]][#] + cosineConstant Cos[#] + sineConstant Sin[#]) & /@ theta),
    \"Q\" -> ((solution[[2]][#] - cosineConstant Sin[#] + sineConstant Cos[#]) & /@ theta),
    \"M\" -> ((solution[[3]][#] + radiusM cosineConstant Cos[#] + radiusM sineConstant Sin[#] + momentConstant) & /@ theta),
    \"globalLoads\" -> globalLoads,
    \"periodicClosure\" -> closureResidual,
    \"balanceMetric\" -> balanceMetric
  |>
];
directResultants[alpha_] := directResultantsFromLoad[
  Function[{angle}, -waterPressureDifferenceKPa - meanEffectivePressureKPa -
    stressDifferenceKPa Cos[2 angle]/2],
  Function[{angle}, alpha stressDifferenceKPa Sin[2 angle]/2],
  sectionRatio
];
directByCase = Association@Table[
  case[\"caseID\"] -> directResultants[case[\"alpha\"]],
  {case, loadCases}
];
directIntegrationTolerance = 10^-4;
directControlRows = Flatten[Table[
  error = Max[Abs[directByCase[case[\"caseID\"]][resultantID] -
    closedByCase[case[\"caseID\"]][resultantID]]];
  <|\"caseID\" -> case[\"caseID\"], \"resultantID\" -> resultantID,
    \"maximumAbsoluteDifference\" -> error, \"limit\" -> directIntegrationTolerance,
    \"pass\" -> error <= directIntegrationTolerance|>,
  {case, loadCases}, {resultantID, {\"N\", \"M\", \"Q\"}}
], 1];
balanceTolerance = config[\"numerics\"][\"balanceTolerance\"];
directBalanceRows = Table[
  metric = directByCase[case[\"caseID\"]][\"balanceMetric\"];
  <|\"caseID\" -> case[\"caseID\"], \"balanceMetric\" -> metric,
    \"limit\" -> balanceTolerance, \"pass\" -> metric <= balanceTolerance|>,
  {case, loadCases}
];
Column[{Dataset[directControlRows], Dataset[directBalanceRows]}]"] , "Input", CellTags -> {"DirectSolution"}],

  Cell["7. Comparación modal de Fourier", "Section"],
  Cell["La comparación de Fourier se limita a los modos n = 0 y n = 2 presentes en este estado de carga. Sus coeficientes se obtienen de la descomposición analítica de las acciones prescritas; no se ajustan sobre la malla ni se copian desde la solución cerrada. Fourier es un control modal y no la ruta principal del cálculo.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData["ClearAll[fourierResultants];
fourierResultants[alpha_] := Module[
  {radialMean, radialCosTwo, tangentialSinTwo,
   meanNormal, meanMoment, normalCosTwo, momentCosTwo, shearSinTwo},
  radialMean = -waterPressureDifferenceKPa - meanEffectivePressureKPa;
  radialCosTwo = -stressDifferenceKPa/2;
  tangentialSinTwo = alpha stressDifferenceKPa/2;
  meanNormal = radiusM radialMean;
  meanMoment = radiusM sectionRatio/(1 + sectionRatio) meanNormal;
  normalCosTwo = radiusM (2 tangentialSinTwo - radialCosTwo)/3;
  momentCosTwo = radiusM^2 (tangentialSinTwo/2 - radialCosTwo)/3;
  shearSinTwo = radiusM (2 radialCosTwo - tangentialSinTwo)/3;
  <|
    \"N\" -> meanNormal + normalCosTwo Cos[2 theta],
    \"M\" -> meanMoment + momentCosTwo Cos[2 theta],
    \"Q\" -> shearSinTwo Sin[2 theta]
  |>
];
fourierByCase = Association@Table[
  case[\"caseID\"] -> fourierResultants[case[\"alpha\"]],
  {case, loadCases}
];
fourierControlRows = Flatten[Table[
  error = Max[Abs[fourierByCase[case[\"caseID\"]][resultantID] -
    closedByCase[case[\"caseID\"]][resultantID]]];
  <|\"caseID\" -> case[\"caseID\"], \"resultantID\" -> resultantID,
    \"maximumAbsoluteDifference\" -> error, \"limit\" -> closedFormTolerance,
    \"pass\" -> error <= closedFormTolerance|>,
  {case, loadCases}, {resultantID, {\"N\", \"M\", \"Q\"}}
], 1];
Dataset[fourierControlRows]"] , "Input", CellTags -> {"FourierControl"}],

  Cell["8. Control de presión uniforme", "Section"],
  Cell["En el límite puramente membranal eta = 0, una presión uniforme p aplicada hacia el interior debe producir N_theta = -p R y valores nulos de M_theta y Q_theta. El tercer argumento de la integración se fija por ello en cero. Este control comprueba signos y dimensiones sin afirmar que M_theta sea nulo cuando la compatibilidad incluye eta > 0.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData["uniformPressureKPa = 12.3;
uniformDirect = directResultantsFromLoad[
  Function[{angle}, -uniformPressureKPa],
  Function[{angle}, 0.],
  0.
];
uniformNormalResidual = Max[Abs[uniformDirect[\"N\"] + uniformPressureKPa radiusM]];
uniformMomentResidual = Max[Abs[uniformDirect[\"M\"]]];
uniformShearResidual = Max[Abs[uniformDirect[\"Q\"]]];
uniformControl = <|
  \"normalForceResidual\" -> uniformNormalResidual,
  \"bendingMomentResidual\" -> uniformMomentResidual,
  \"shearForceResidual\" -> uniformShearResidual,
  \"limit\" -> directIntegrationTolerance,
  \"pass\" -> Max[uniformNormalResidual, uniformMomentResidual, uniformShearResidual] <= directIntegrationTolerance
|>;
Dataset[{uniformControl}]"] , "Input", CellTags -> {"UniformPressureControl"}],

  Cell["9. Diagramas angulares", "Section"],
  Cell["Los gráficos siguientes permiten inspeccionar los dos valores de alpha sobre la misma malla. Son gráficos de trabajo del cuaderno y no sustituyen las figuras Highcharter de la memoria.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData["resultantLabels = <|\"N\" -> \"N_theta [kN/m]\", \"M\" -> \"M_theta [kN m/m]\", \"Q\" -> \"Q_theta [kN/m]\"|>;
Column[Table[
  ListLinePlot[
    Table[Transpose[{theta 180/Pi, directByCase[case[\"caseID\"]][resultantID]}], {case, loadCases}],
    PlotLegends -> Lookup[loadCases, \"caseID\"],
    Frame -> True,
    FrameLabel -> {\"theta [deg]\", resultantLabels[resultantID]},
    PlotRange -> All,
    ImageSize -> Large
  ],
  {resultantID, {\"N\", \"M\", \"Q\"}}
]]"] , "Input", CellTags -> {"ResultantPlots"}],

  Cell["10. Comparación con la implementación R", "Section"],
  Cell["Los CSV de R se leen sólo después de completar el cálculo Wolfram. La comparación exige igualdad del escenario, estados categóricos, metadatos, unidades y malla; limita la diferencia absoluta de cada vector de resultantes a 10^-7 en su propia unidad. Para los extremos, Wolfram adopta el primer índice entre posiciones equivalentes dentro de esa tolerancia. El ángulo representativo de R puede diferir por ruido numérico: debe pertenecer al mismo conjunto equivalente, y su valor con signo se comprueba en ese ángulo. La serie comparada con R es la solución cerrada; la integración directa conserva su control secundario independiente.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData["referenceSection = First[importCSV[FileNameJoin[{projectRoot, \"data\", \"calculation\", \"section.properties.csv\"}]]];
referenceStress = First[importCSV[FileNameJoin[{projectRoot, \"data\", \"calculation\", \"stress.state.csv\"}]]];
referenceLoads = importCSV[FileNameJoin[{projectRoot, \"data\", \"calculation\", \"perimeter.loads.csv\"}]];
referenceResultants = importCSV[FileNameJoin[{projectRoot, \"data\", \"calculation\", \"section.resultants.csv\"}]];
referenceExtrema = importCSV[FileNameJoin[{projectRoot, \"data\", \"calculation\", \"section.extrema.csv\"}]];
sectionFields = {\"interpolationFraction\", \"areaMm2PerMm\", \"inertiaMm4PerMm\", \"extensionalRigidityKnPerM\", \"flexuralRigidityKnM2PerM\", \"sectionRatio\"};
sectionRelativeErrors = Association@Table[
  field -> Abs[sectionState[field] - referenceSection[field]]/Max[1., Abs[referenceSection[field]]],
  {field, sectionFields}
];
stressChecks = <|
  \"scenarioID\" -> (referenceStress[\"scenarioID\"] === scenarioID),
  \"modelID\" -> (referenceStress[\"modelID\"] === stressState[\"modelID\"]),
  \"statePointID\" -> (referenceStress[\"statePointID\"] === config[\"stressState\"][\"statePointID\"]),
  \"domainStatus\" -> (referenceStress[\"domainStatus\"] === stressState[\"domainStatus\"]),
  \"horizontalIncrementStatus\" -> (referenceStress[\"horizontalIncrementStatus\"] === horizontalIncrementStatus),
  \"horizontalIncrementUnknown\" -> (referenceStress[\"horizontalIncrementKPa\"] === \"\"),
  \"k0DerivedNotApplicable\" -> (referenceStress[\"k0Derived\"] === \"\"),
  \"k0Input\" -> (Abs[referenceStress[\"k0Input\"] - stressState[\"k0Input\"]] <= 10^-12),
  \"k0Applied\" -> (Abs[referenceStress[\"k0Applied\"] - k0Applied] <= 10^-12),
  \"effectiveVerticalKPa\" -> (Abs[referenceStress[\"effectiveVerticalKPa\"] - effectiveVerticalKPa] <= 10^-10),
  \"effectiveHorizontalKPa\" -> (Abs[referenceStress[\"effectiveHorizontalKPa\"] - effectiveHorizontalKPa] <= 10^-10),
  \"waterPressureDifferenceKPa\" -> (Abs[referenceStress[\"waterPressureDifferenceKPa\"] - waterPressureDifferenceKPa] <= 10^-10)
|>;
sectionChecks = Map[# <= 10^-12 &, sectionRelativeErrors];
sectionMetadataChecks = <|
  \"scenarioID\" -> (referenceSection[\"scenarioID\"] === scenarioID),
  \"profileID\" -> (referenceSection[\"profileID\"] === profileID),
  \"propertyModelID\" -> (referenceSection[\"propertyModelID\"] === config[\"section\"][\"propertyModelID\"]),
  \"lowerReferenceRowID\" -> (referenceSection[\"lowerReferenceRowID\"] === sectionState[\"lowerReferenceRowID\"]),
  \"upperReferenceRowID\" -> (referenceSection[\"upperReferenceRowID\"] === sectionState[\"upperReferenceRowID\"]),
  \"domainStatus\" -> (referenceSection[\"domainStatus\"] === \"within-interpolation-range\")
|>;
expectedResultantUnits = <|\"N\" -> \"kN/m\", \"M\" -> \"kN m/m\", \"Q\" -> \"kN/m\"|>;
expectedStressStateID = scenarioID <> \"-\" <> config[\"stressState\"][\"statePointID\"];
thetaReference = Lookup[
  Select[referenceResultants, #[\"caseID\"] == First[Lookup[loadCases, \"caseID\"]] && #[\"resultantID\"] == \"N\" &],
  \"thetaRad\"
];
thetaError = Max[Abs[theta - thetaReference]];
loadControlRows = Flatten[Table[
  referenceRows = Select[referenceLoads,
    #[\"caseID\"] == case[\"caseID\"] && #[\"componentID\"] == componentID &];
  referenceVector = Lookup[referenceRows, \"valueKPa\"];
  wolframVector = actionsByCase[case[\"caseID\"]][If[componentID == \"radial\", \"Pr\", \"Pt\"]];
  metadataPass = Length[referenceRows] == Length[theta] && AllTrue[referenceRows,
    #[\"scenarioID\"] === scenarioID && #[\"caseID\"] === case[\"caseID\"] &&
    Abs[#[\"alpha\"] - case[\"alpha\"]] <= 10^-12 &&
    #[\"stressStateID\"] === expectedStressStateID && #[\"evidenceLevel\"] === \"DE\" &];
  error = If[Length[referenceVector] == Length[wolframVector],
    Max[Abs[wolframVector - referenceVector]], Infinity];
  <|\"caseID\" -> case[\"caseID\"], \"componentID\" -> componentID,
    \"maximumAbsoluteDifference\" -> error, \"metadataPass\" -> metadataPass,
    \"limit\" -> 10^-10, \"pass\" -> metadataPass && error <= 10^-10|>,
  {case, loadCases}, {componentID, {\"radial\", \"tangential\"}}
], 1];
resultantParityRows = Flatten[Table[
  referenceRows = Select[referenceResultants,
    #[\"caseID\"] == case[\"caseID\"] && #[\"resultantID\"] == resultantID &];
  referenceVector = Lookup[referenceRows, \"value\"];
  wolframVector = closedByCase[case[\"caseID\"]][resultantID];
  metadataPass = Length[referenceRows] == Length[theta] && AllTrue[referenceRows,
    #[\"scenarioID\"] === scenarioID && #[\"caseID\"] === case[\"caseID\"] &&
    Abs[#[\"alpha\"] - case[\"alpha\"]] <= 10^-12 &&
    #[\"stressStateID\"] === expectedStressStateID &&
    #[\"sectionID\"] === referenceSection[\"sectionID\"] &&
    #[\"unit\"] === expectedResultantUnits[resultantID] && #[\"evidenceLevel\"] === \"DE\" &];
  error = If[Length[referenceVector] == Length[wolframVector],
    Max[Abs[wolframVector - referenceVector]], Infinity];
  <|\"caseID\" -> case[\"caseID\"], \"resultantID\" -> resultantID,
    \"maximumAbsoluteDifference\" -> error, \"metadataPass\" -> metadataPass,
    \"unit\" -> expectedResultantUnits[resultantID], \"limit\" -> closedFormTolerance,
    \"pass\" -> metadataPass && error <= closedFormTolerance|>,
  {case, loadCases}, {resultantID, {\"N\", \"M\", \"Q\"}}
], 1];
extremeParityRows = Flatten[Table[
  summaryRow = First[Select[closedSummary,
    #[\"caseID\"] === case[\"caseID\"] && #[\"resultantID\"] === resultantID &&
    #[\"statisticID\"] === statisticID &]];
  referenceRow = First[Select[referenceExtrema,
    #[\"caseID\"] === case[\"caseID\"] && #[\"resultantID\"] === resultantID &&
    #[\"statisticID\"] === statisticID &]];
  referenceIndex = First[FirstPosition[theta,
    angle_ /; Abs[angle - referenceRow[\"thetaRad\"]] <= 10^-12]];
  signedAtReference = closedByCase[case[\"caseID\"]][resultantID][[referenceIndex]];
  valueDifference = Abs[summaryRow[\"value\"] - referenceRow[\"value\"]];
  signedDifference = Abs[signedAtReference - referenceRow[\"signedValue\"]];
  angleEquivalent = AnyTrue[summaryRow[\"equivalentThetaDeg\"],
    Abs[# - referenceRow[\"thetaDeg\"]] <= closedFormTolerance 180/Pi &];
  metadataPass = referenceRow[\"scenarioID\"] === scenarioID &&
    referenceRow[\"caseID\"] === case[\"caseID\"] &&
    Abs[referenceRow[\"alpha\"] - case[\"alpha\"]] <= 10^-12 &&
    referenceRow[\"resultantID\"] === resultantID &&
    referenceRow[\"statisticID\"] === statisticID &&
    referenceRow[\"unit\"] === expectedResultantUnits[resultantID] &&
    referenceRow[\"evidenceLevel\"] === \"DE\";
  <|\"caseID\" -> case[\"caseID\"], \"resultantID\" -> resultantID,
    \"statisticID\" -> statisticID,
    \"representativeThetaDeg\" -> summaryRow[\"thetaDeg\"],
    \"referenceThetaDeg\" -> referenceRow[\"thetaDeg\"],
    \"referenceAngleEquivalent\" -> angleEquivalent,
    \"valueDifference\" -> valueDifference,
    \"signedValueAtReferenceDifference\" -> signedDifference,
    \"metadataPass\" -> metadataPass, \"limit\" -> closedFormTolerance,
    \"pass\" -> metadataPass && angleEquivalent &&
      valueDifference <= closedFormTolerance && signedDifference <= closedFormTolerance|>,
  {case, loadCases}, {resultantID, {\"N\", \"M\", \"Q\"}},
  {statisticID, {\"minimum\", \"maximum\", \"absolute-maximum\"}}
], 2];
Column[{Dataset[Join[loadControlRows, resultantParityRows]], Dataset[extremeParityRows]}]"] , "Input", CellTags -> {"RParity"}],

  Cell["11. Estado de la recuperación de tensión de chapa", "Section"],
  Cell["La recuperación lineal requiere una sección neta aprobada, las coordenadas firmadas de las fibras interior y exterior y un criterio de aplicabilidad frente a la curvatura. Esos datos no pertenecen al escenario verification-biaxial-uniform. El cuaderno informa la tensión como no evaluada y no reemplaza las entradas faltantes por propiedades brutas o valores supuestos.", "Text"],
  Cell["sigma_theta,lin [MPa] = N_theta [kN/m]/A_n [mm2/mm] - 1000 M_theta [kN m/m] y_c [mm]/I_n [mm4/mm]", "Equation"],
  Cell[BoxData["sheetStressEvaluated = False;
outerStressMPa = Missing[\"NotAvailable\"];
innerStressMPa = Missing[\"NotAvailable\"];
sheetStressMissingInputs = {
    \"netSection\",
    \"signedOuterFibreCoordinate\",
    \"signedInnerFibreCoordinate\",
    \"approvedCurvatureApplicabilityCriterion\"
};
Grid[{
  {\"Resultado\", \"No evaluada para este escenario\"},
  {\"Entradas faltantes\", Column[sheetStressMissingInputs]},
  {\"Tensión en la fibra exterior [MPa]\", outerStressMPa},
  {\"Tensión en la fibra interior [MPa]\", innerStressMPa},
  {\"Magnitudes excluidas\", \"Contribución de Q_theta, tensión longitudinal, von Mises, resistencia y utilización\"}
}, Alignment -> Left, Frame -> All]"] , "Input", CellTags -> {"SheetStressStatus"}],

  Cell["12. Resultado del control", "Section"],
  Cell[BoxData["overallPass = And[
  And @@ Values[stressChecks],
  And @@ Values[sectionChecks],
  And @@ Values[sectionMetadataChecks],
  thetaError <= 10^-14,
  And @@ Lookup[directControlRows, \"pass\"],
  And @@ Lookup[directBalanceRows, \"pass\"],
  And @@ Lookup[fourierControlRows, \"pass\"],
  TrueQ[uniformControl[\"pass\"]],
  And @@ Lookup[loadControlRows, \"pass\"],
  And @@ Lookup[resultantParityRows, \"pass\"],
  And @@ Lookup[extremeParityRows, \"pass\"]
];
controlStatus = <|
  \"scenarioID\" -> scenarioID,
  \"thetaPointCount\" -> Length[theta],
  \"thetaMaximumAbsoluteDifference\" -> thetaError,
  \"directVsClosedPass\" -> And @@ Lookup[directControlRows, \"pass\"],
  \"directBalancePass\" -> And @@ Lookup[directBalanceRows, \"pass\"],
  \"fourierVsClosedPass\" -> And @@ Lookup[fourierControlRows, \"pass\"],
  \"uniformPressurePass\" -> TrueQ[uniformControl[\"pass\"]],
  \"loadsVsRPass\" -> And @@ Lookup[loadControlRows, \"pass\"],
  \"resultantsVsRPass\" -> And @@ Lookup[resultantParityRows, \"pass\"],
  \"extremaVsRPass\" -> And @@ Lookup[extremeParityRows, \"pass\"],
  \"sectionVsRPass\" -> And @@ Values[sectionChecks],
  \"sectionMetadataVsRPass\" -> And @@ Values[sectionMetadataChecks],
  \"stressStateVsRPass\" -> And @@ Values[stressChecks],
  \"overallPass\" -> overallPass,
  \"sheetStressEvaluated\" -> sheetStressEvaluated,
  \"wolframVersion\" -> $Version
|>;
Dataset[{controlStatus}]"] , "Input", CellTags -> {"FinalStatus"}],

  Cell["Interpretación", "Section"],
  Cell["Un resultado overallPass = True demuestra correspondencia numérica entre tres formulaciones del mismo problema determinístico y la implementación R para el escenario fijado. No constituye una validación física del estado tensional del relleno ni una verificación resistente del revestimiento existente.", "Text"]
},
WindowSize -> {1280, 900},
WindowMargins -> {{Automatic, 40}, {Automatic, 40}},
Magnification -> 1.0,
StyleDefinitions -> "Default.nb"
]
